cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or material, please cite the manuscript and this repository."
type: software
title: "Unrecorded milkings and session-aware milk-yield monitoring in dairy herds under heat stress"
abstract: >
  Source code accompanying the manuscript "Session-aware milk-yield monitoring for
  early warning in dairy herds under heat stress: unrecorded milkings, validation
  against veterinary records and herd-level response to heat". Computes a deviation
  of daily milk yield from each milking and its interval, tests it against veterinary
  and management records, estimates the response of herd yield to heat load, and
  evaluates daily lists of cows at risk on farms and in years not used for fitting.
  The code of an earlier version of the study (release v1.0) is kept in the repository.

